  m_text: Your first day of work left you exhausted. You didn't know what to expect
    from the job description, but it certainly wasn't that. They didn't even show
    you patience on your first day, so you can only imagine how much of a pain this
    job will be. Just when you thought you finally found a well-paying job that only
    needed a high school diploma... you need a drink. You recall walking by a bar
    on your way to work, so you seek it out.
